namespace MARIA

features
  MARIA
    mandatory
      SprintSession
      TechniquesCatalog

  SprintSession
    mandatory
      ProblemDefinition
      TargetUser
    optional
      PainPoints
      InitialIdea
      Stages
      LLMConfiguration
    or
      Techniques

  Stages
    or
      Empatizar
      Definir
      Idear
      Prototipar
      Testear

  Techniques
    or
      // Empatizar
      MapaEmpatia
      Entrevistas
      CustomerJourney
      // Definir
      LongTermGoal
      SprintQuestions
      HowMightWe
      POV
      // Idear
      Brainstorming
      // Prototipar
      Prototipado
      Map
      GenerateMap
      // Testear
      Testing

  TechniquesCatalog
    or
      BuiltinTechnique
      CustomTechnique

  BuiltinTechnique
    mandatory
      BuiltinPrompt
    optional
      Questionnaire

  CustomTechnique
    mandatory
      CustomPromptText
      TechId
    optional
      StageAssignment
      Questionnaire

  Questionnaire
    or
      TextQuestion
      TextareaQuestion
      NumberQuestion
      SelectQuestion

  LLMConfiguration
    alternative
      GoogleGemini
      OpenAIGPT
      AnthropicClaude

  GoogleGemini
    mandatory
      GoogleApiKey

  OpenAIGPT
    mandatory
      OpenAIApiKey

  AnthropicClaude
    mandatory
      AnthropicApiKey

constraints
  SprintQuestions => LongTermGoal
  Map => LongTermGoal
  Map => SprintQuestions
  GenerateMap => Map
  MapaEmpatia => Empatizar
  Entrevistas => Empatizar
  CustomerJourney => Empatizar
  LongTermGoal => Definir
  SprintQuestions => Definir
  HowMightWe => Definir
  POV => Definir
  Brainstorming => Idear
  Prototipado => Prototipar
  Map => Prototipar
  GenerateMap => Prototipar
  Testing => Testear
  CustomTechnique => !BuiltinTechnique
